#### STD-FE-008: No Full Library Imports

**MUST NOT** import an entire library when only specific functions are needed. Use named imports or dynamic imports for large dependencies.

```tsx
// ❌ NON-COMPLIANT — imports entire lodash (~70KB gzipped)
import _ from 'lodash';

// ✅ COMPLIANT — tree-shakeable named import
import { debounce } from 'lodash-es';
```

