[standards/application/frontend/STD-APP-FE-001-react-application-standards.md#std-fe-017-playwright-for-e2e-tests]

#### STD-FE-017: Playwright for E2E Tests

**MUST** use Playwright for end-to-end tests. The `@axe-core/playwright` package **MUST** be used in page-level E2E tests to run axe-core against all interactive page states.

```bash
npm install --save-dev @playwright/test @axe-core/playwright
```

```typescript
// e2e/claims-form.spec.ts
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';
import AxeBuilder from '@axe-core/playwright';

test('claims form has no WCAG 2.2 AA violations', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/claims/new');
  const results = await new AxeBuilder({ page })
    .withTags(['wcag2a', 'wcag2aa', 'wcag22aa'])
    .analyze();
  expect(results.violations).toEqual([]);
});
```

