#### STD-FE-022: Zustand for Module-Scoped Global State

**MUST** use Zustand for application-level global state within a remote module. Redux, MobX, and Recoil are not permitted in new work. TanStack Query **MUST** be used for server state (fetching, caching, synchronisation).

```typescript
// ✅ COMPLIANT — one Zustand store per module
import { create } from 'zustand';

interface ClaimsFilterState {
  statusFilter: string[];
  setStatusFilter: (filters: string[]) => void;
}

export const useClaimsFilterStore = create<ClaimsFilterState>((set) => ({
  statusFilter: [],
  setStatusFilter: (filters) => set({ statusFilter: filters }),
}));
```
